    "m_qwen3_4b_avoid": "CPU masu rauni ko amsoshi masu sauri: idan tunani yana kunne, amsoshi suna daɗewa kuma suna jinkiri. Ilimin gaskiya mai yawa har yanzu yana da iyaka a wannan girman.",
    "m_qwen2_5_coder_1_5b_good": "Samfurin Qwen na lamba kaɗai (Qwen2.5-Coder): ingantaccen samar da lamba, tunani kan lamba da gyaran lamba fiye da magabatansa na gabaɗaya, yayin da yake riƙe wasu ƙwarewar lissafi da ta gabaɗaya. Context na token 32K, Apache 2.0.",
    "m_qwen2_5_coder_1_5b_use": "Rubuta, bayyana da gyara lamba, ƙananan scripts da snippets a kan PC masu ƙarancin ƙarfi.",
    "m_qwen2_5_coder_1_5b_avoid": "Ayyukan da ba na lamba ba da matsalolin injiniya masu wahala: ƙaramin samfuri ne kuma yana yin kurakurai fiye da manyan girman Coder.",
    "m_qwen2_5_coder_7b_good": "Samfurin Qwen na lamba kaɗai: ƙarfin samar da lamba, tunani kan lamba da gyaran lamba; tushe ga wakilan lamba. Context na token 32K (katin ya ambaci har zuwa 128K da YaRN). Apache 2.0.",
