    "m_starcoder2_15b_instruct_good": "Sigar instruct ta StarCoder2-15B da aka daidaita da kanta, an yi ta ne don amsa umarnin lamba a juyi ɗaya; an daidaita ta musamman don ayyukan Python da za a iya tabbatarwa. Lasisin BigCode OpenRAIL-M v1 (ana amfani da ƙuntatawar amfani).",
    "m_starcoder2_15b_instruct_use": "Buƙatun lamba na sau ɗaya, galibi Python, a kan PC mai RAM mai yawa sosai.",
