    "m_phi_3_5_mini_good": "Haaromsa Microsoft June hanga August 2024 kan Phi-3 mini: qulqullina afaan hedduu, haasaa multi-turn fi yaadaa keessatti fooyya'insa, context token 128K fi afaanota 23 tarreeffaman waliin. Parameters 3.8B, hayyama MIT.",
