    "m_phi_4_mini_good": "Phi-4-mini Microsoft (February 2025): caasaa haaraa jechoota token 200K, grouped-query attention fi embeddings qoodaman waliin, qajeelfama hordofuu fi function calling fooyya'e. Context token 128K, parameters 3.8B, hayyama MIT.",
